@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+Fixed the source of an assertion error including the decorators of the following
+statement when the statement being reported was followed by a decorated function
+or class (regression introduced in Python 3.8 due to the change in how the
+``lineno`` of decorated definitions is reported).
